      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ELUMBARD MUSTARD\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nTake Mustard seed and wash it \u0026 drye it in an oven, grind it drye. Farse it though a farse. Clarify honey with wine \u0026 vinegar \u0026 stere it well together and make it blanched ynowz. \u0026 when thou wilt spend thereof make it thin with wine.\u003Cbr\u003E"
